---
import SiteLayout from "@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { communityChannels } from "@/lib/site";
---

<SiteLayout title="About" description="Augur project, foundation, and community channels.">
  <main class="site-frame site-scaffold">
    <p class="site-scaffold__status augur-type-metadata">Implementation scaffold · not production copy</p>
    <h1 class="augur-type-editorial-title">About Augur</h1>
    <p class="site-scaffold__question">Who is behind the work, and how can I reach them?</p>
    <section id="foundation">
      <h2 class="augur-type-editorial-section">Lituus Foundation</h2>
      <p>The foundation’s funding and development-support role is described in the website strategy. Its precise operator attribution and public details require maintainer review.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="community">
      <h2 class="augur-type-editorial-section">Community and contact</h2>
      <p>Augur is a community project. Questions, ideas and reports go to its community channels, with Discord as the main place for discussion.</p>
      <ul>
        {communityChannels.map(({ label, handle, href }) => (
          <li><a href={href}>{label}</a> — {handle}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
